{"articleNo":"416879","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=416879&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2022-2학기 재수강 신청자 이전 취득 성적 삭제 예정 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.11.18","hit":"6235","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕;\">2022-2학기 재수강 신청자의 이전 취득 성적을 다음과 같이 취소처리할 예정이오니,&nbsp;</span></span></b></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕;\">재수강내역에 오류가 있으신 분은 7029로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕;\">&nbsp;</span></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕;\">&nbsp;○ 취소일시: 2022.11.21(화) 수업일수 3/4선</span></span></font></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><b><br></b></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;- 학사운영규정 제177조(성적의 취소 및 이수구분 변경)</span></span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이미 취득한 성적은 취소 할 수 없다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">다만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">다음 각 호의 어느 하나에 해당하는 성적은 취소할 수 있다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -11.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -28.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -28.4pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">현행 